  "rationale": "material-economy (tasks 1-6) added four material kinds (labor, essence, insight, passage) and priced five god verbs with materialCost. Adding costs to previously free verbs is an accept, not a regression. At the 2400-tick ascension horizon, every knowledge metric rose and population fell. This is the expected direction: allocation becomes non-trivial when verbs that were free now cost materials, and the sinks create genuine tradeoffs. The ascension gate is the only instrument that can observe whether anyone can still win, and the re-record confirms the win condition remains reachable.",
